{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%.1f s": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%.1f 秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ already on this device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這支手機上已有 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · nothing is sent anywhere else, and nothing is kept afterwards.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · 不會送到其他任何地方，事後也不會留下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@: failed": {
      "comment": "One ZK verification check",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@：未通過"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@: passed": {
      "comment": "One ZK verification check",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@：通過"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%d fields · created %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%d 個欄位 · %@ 建立"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%d file(s) left over: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "殘留 %d 個檔案：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%llu ms": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%llu 毫秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "(blank)": {
      "comment": "A disclosed field whose value is empty",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "（空白）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A file this app ships with is missing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 內建的檔案遺失了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fresh identifier was issued": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "產生了全新的識別碼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A proof was created but nothing checked it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已產生證明，但沒有任何人驗過它"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A real cardholder — but not that this is their first time. Offline there is no shared record of what has already been used, so two checkers who never speak cannot both refuse the same person.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "證明得了「是真的持卡人」，證明不了「這是他第一次」。離線的時候沒有一份共用的紀錄可以查誰用過，所以兩個彼此不通訊的查驗者，沒辦法一起擋下同一個人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A refusal is not proof of a forgery. A wrong clock, a partial scan, or an out-of-date app produce the same answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「未通過」不等於偽造。裝置時間不準、條碼沒掃完、App 版本太舊，都會得到同樣的結果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A stored credential is damaged and cannot be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已儲存的憑證損毀，無法讀取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A zero-knowledge proof is about 290 KB — too large for a QR code, so it arrives as a file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "零知識證明大約 290 KB——太大了塞不進 QR code，所以是用檔案傳過來的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A zero-knowledge proof is about 400 KB — far too large for a QR code, so it arrives over Bluetooth or as a file.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "零知識證明約 400 KB——遠遠超過 QR code 裝得下的量，所以它走藍牙或檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A123456789": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A123456789"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About Bond": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關於有備而來"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About the person showing it": {
      "comment": "Caveat group subtitle",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關於出示它的人"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About this document": {
      "comment": "Caveat group subtitle",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關於這份文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Address of household": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "戶籍地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All information are stored only on your phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有資料僅儲存在你的手機中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Already prepared": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已經備妥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also sending this over Bluetooth, so the checker does not have to scan every code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同時也用藍牙傳送，這樣查驗方不必一張一張掃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always shown": {
      "comment": "Trailing text on the field the holder cannot withhold",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一律出示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answer a checker's code. Works with no network on either phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "掃描查驗者的條碼並回應，兩支手機都不需要網路。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answered with a zero-knowledge proof, sent over Bluetooth. The checker never sees your certificate — but every checker sees the same duplicate-detection number, so they can still tell it is the same person.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用零知識證明回答，走藍牙傳送。查驗方看不到你的憑證——但每一個查驗方看到的去重編號都是同一個，所以他們仍然分辨得出這是同一個人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answered with your signed document, shown as QR codes or over Bluetooth. The checker sees your name either way — your certificate has to travel with it, and your name is inside the certificate.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用你已簽章的證件回答，以 QR code 或藍牙出示。無論走哪一種，查驗方都會看到你的姓名——憑證必須一起送出，而姓名就在憑證裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask the other person to scan this": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請對方掃描這個條碼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back up my national ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "備份我的身分證件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back up your national ID from the home screen first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請先從首頁備份你的身分證件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before you start": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開始之前"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Birth date": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出生日期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth could not be set up on this phone (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這支手機無法設定藍牙（%@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth is not ready (state %d).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "藍牙尚未就緒（狀態 %d）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth is switched off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "藍牙已關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth pairing code": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "藍牙配對碼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth was offered but this document could not be prepared for it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "對方提供了藍牙，但這份證件無法為它準備好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bond": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有備而來"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both circuits completed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩組電路都完成了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Built on this phone from your MyData record, and signed with your digital certificate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在這支手機上用你的 MyData 資料做出來的，由你的自然人憑證簽章。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Camera access is turned off by a restriction on this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這台裝置的使用限制關閉了相機權限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can't start": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法開始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Certificate chain": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "憑證鏈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Certificate chain checking key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "憑證鏈驗證金鑰"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Certificate chain proving key": {
      "comment": "ZK circuit asset",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "憑證鏈證明金鑰"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Certificate revocation snapshot": {
      "comment": "ZK circuit asset",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "憑證撤銷清單快照"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check a document": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗證件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check a document someone shows you, without contacting any server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗別人出示的證件，全程不連任何伺服器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check a proof": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗證明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check a proof file. The checking files are on this phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗一份證明檔。查驗用的檔案已在這支手機上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check a proof file. The large checking files are not downloaded yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗一份證明檔。大型查驗檔案尚未下載。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check a zero-knowledge proof": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗零知識證明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check result": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗結果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check someone else's document": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗他人證件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the proof on this device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在這支手機上驗證證明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checked in %@, with no network": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 完成驗證，全程未連網"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checked on this device: the proof does not hold": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已在這支手機上驗證：證明不成立"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checked on this device: the proof holds": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已在這支手機上驗證：證明成立"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checked on this phone, and it passed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在這支手機上查驗過，通過"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking what's already downloaded…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在檢查已經下載了哪些檔案…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a proof file": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選擇證明檔案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose what they will see": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選擇要讓對方看到什麼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Code %1$d of %2$d": {
      "comment": "Carousel position",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第 %1$d／%2$d 張"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Computed on this phone from your digital certificate. The certificate itself is never shown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在這支手機上用你的自然人憑證算出來的。憑證本身不會被交出去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "確認"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "繼續"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copied": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已複製"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not reach the digital certificate service.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法連線到行動自然人憑證服務。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not read": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法讀取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't check the verification files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法檢查驗證檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create a Valid Document": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建立正式證件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create a proof": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開始產生證明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create a valid document from the home screen first. Nothing can be shown until this device holds one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請先從首頁建立有效證件。這台裝置還沒有證件之前，沒有東西可以出示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create the proof": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "產生證明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Created": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建立時間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Creates a mathematical proof that your 自然人憑證 was issued by 內政部憑證管理中心, and checks its serial number against a revocation list this app cannot confirm is complete. The person checking the proof never sees your name, your ID number, or the certificate itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "產生一份數學證明，說明你的自然人憑證是由內政部憑證管理中心簽發，並把序號拿去比對一份撤銷清單——但這個 App 無法確認那份清單是完整的。查驗證明的人不會看到你的姓名、身分證統一編號，也不會看到憑證本身。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Credential store": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "憑證儲存區"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Data and Privacy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "資料與隱私"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Date of birth": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出生年月日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diagnostics": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "診斷"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discoverable over Bluetooth — waiting for the checker to connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已可透過藍牙被找到——等待查驗方連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
