      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "錯誤"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every checker sees the same duplicate-detection number, so two of them can tell they saw the same person.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一個查驗方看到的去重編號都是同一個，所以兩個查驗方對得出他們看過同一個人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every field in your document: name, ID number, date of birth, household address and nationality. This version cannot show only part of it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "證件裡的每一個欄位：姓名、統一編號、出生日期、戶籍地址與國籍。這個版本無法只出示其中一部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everyday": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "平時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Excluded from backup": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已排除備份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Expected here — there is no Secure Enclave to use.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這裡本來就是這樣——沒有安全隔離區可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Experimental": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "實驗中"
