          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not excluded": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未排除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not measured yet — download your ID once and come back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "還沒量過——先跑一次身分證下載，再回來看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not started": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未開始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is selected to begin with. Whatever you leave off is not sent — the checker sees only that some fields were held back, not what they were.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設一項都不給。沒有勾的欄位不會送出——查驗方只會看到「有幾項被保留」，看不到那些是什麼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is sent anywhere. This check works with the phone in aeroplane mode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不會向外傳送任何資料。開飛航模式也能完成這次查驗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing left over": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有殘留"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing ties this proof to the person checking it, so it could be shown again elsewhere.": {
      "comment": "Limitation attached to a zero-knowledge proof",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個證明沒有綁定眼前的查驗者，可能被拿到別處再次出示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing was checked": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有東西被查驗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline check": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "離線出示與查驗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline there is no shared record of what has been used, so two checkers who never speak cannot both refuse the same person.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "離線的時候沒有一份共用的紀錄可以查誰用過，所以兩個彼此不通訊的查驗方，沒辦法一起擋下同一個人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only half of that": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只做得到一半"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the fields you switch on, the same way as your own document.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有你打開的那些欄位，跟你自己那份文件一樣。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the fields you switch on. The rest stay as salted commitments the checker cannot open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有你打開的那些欄位。其餘的維持成加了鹽的承諾，查驗方打不開。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟「設定」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
