    "Save this proof as a file": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把這份證明存成檔案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saves a %@ file to send by AirDrop or Files. Far too large for a QR code — it would be 824 codes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存成一個 %@ 的檔案，用 AirDrop 或「檔案」傳送。對 QR code 來說太大了——那會是 824 張。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saves a %@ file. Too large for a QR code — send it as a file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存成一個 %@ 的檔案。太大了塞不進 QR code——請用檔案傳送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan the checker's code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "掃描查驗方的碼"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Scan the checker's code and %@ goes straight to their phone — about twenty seconds. Nothing is stored anywhere else.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "掃描查驗方的碼，%@ 直接送到對方手機——大約二十秒。不會留在任何其他地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan their document": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "掃描對方的證件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scanning this only tells the other phone where to send the proof. It is not a one-time number — the proof was made before you asked for it, so nothing here stops the same proof being sent again later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "掃這個碼只是告訴對方的手機要把證明送到哪裡。它不是一次性亂數——那份證明在你要求之前就已經產生好了，所以沒有任何機制阻止同一份證明日後再被送一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Secure Enclave": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安全隔離區（Secure Enclave）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Self-check": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自我檢查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
