    "Show your document?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要出示證件嗎？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Showing this document always reveals your name, because it is written into the certificate that signs it. The same certificate goes to every checker, so any two of them can tell it was the same person.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出示這份證件一定會露出你的姓名——姓名寫在替它簽章的憑證裡。每個查驗方拿到的都是同一張憑證，所以任兩個查驗方都能看出是同一個人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign with your digital certificate": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用自然人憑證簽章"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign your national ID details": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "簽署你的身分證欄位"
