    "This presentation was made for a different checker.": {
      "comment": "Offline verification failure",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這次出示是給其他查驗端的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This proof cannot show whether the same identity has already been used elsewhere.": {
      "comment": "Limitation attached to a zero-knowledge proof",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個證明無法顯示同一個身分是否已經在別處用過。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This proof carries the same personal number every time and to every checker, so any two checkers can tell it was the same person. It hides who you are, not that you are the same one.": {
      "comment": "Limitation attached to a zero-knowledge proof",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這份證明每次、對每一位查驗者都帶著同一組個人編號，任兩位查驗者都能比對出是同一個人。它藏住的是你是誰，不是「你是同一個人」這件事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This proof could not be packaged": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這份證明無法打包"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This proof could not be sent": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這份證明無法傳送"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This proof file could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個證明檔案讀不出來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This proof is %1$@, which is more than the %2$@ this app will send over Bluetooth. Save it as a file instead.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這份證明是 %1$@，超過這個 App 願意用藍牙傳送的 %2$@。請改存成檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This proves who issued the certificate, not that it is still valid today.": {
      "comment": "Limitation attached to a zero-knowledge proof",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這只證明憑證由誰簽發，不證明它今天仍然有效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This request could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法讀取這個查驗請求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This takes a while and uses a lot of memory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這一步要花一段時間，而且很吃記憶體。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This takes about fifteen seconds and runs entirely on this phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大約需要十五秒，全程在這支手機上跑，不連任何伺服器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version cannot sign documents yet. Signing has to go through the bonds-tw service, which is not available in this build.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個版本還不能簽署證件。簽署要經過 bonds-tw 的服務，而這個版本連不上它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This wording was written by the checker. This app cannot confirm who they are.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這段文字是查驗者自己填的。本 App 無法確認對方的身分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three kinds of document, three different trust models. Each one gives something up, and it is not the same something — which is only visible with all three on one screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三種文件，三種不同的信任模型。每一種都放棄了一些東西，而且放棄的不是同一樣——那件事只有在三張並排的時候看得見。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three things someone might ask this app to prove, and what it can honestly answer today. Two of the three are only half answered, and this page says which half.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有人可能會要求這個 App 證明的三件事，以及它今天誠實答得出什麼。三件裡有兩件只答得出一半，這一頁說明是哪一半。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time to create the proof": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "產生證明耗時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Took %.1f seconds · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "花了 %.1f 秒 · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total size when installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安裝後總大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try again": {
      "comment": "Retry minting a verification request",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再試一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turning on Bluetooth…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在開啟藍牙…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unavailable": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unified No.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "統一編號"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unzipping failed (wrong password). Please enter the correct National ID number.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解壓縮失敗（密碼錯誤），請輸入正確的身分證字號。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Valid Document": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正式證件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verification files": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "驗證檔案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verification files are ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "驗證檔案已備妥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verification request code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗請求條碼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for approval in the digital certificate app…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待你在行動自然人憑證 App 上完成核可…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for you to sign in 行動自然人憑證": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等你在行動自然人憑證上簽名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What a checker can rely on:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗方可以倚賴的："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What arrived was not a proof this app can read.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收到的東西不是這個 App 讀得懂的證明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What each card is worth": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一張卡值多少"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What every checker learns": {
      "comment": "Caveat group subtitle",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每個查驗方都會知道的事"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it actually shows": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它實際上證明了什麼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it cannot establish:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它建立不了的："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it cannot show": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它證明不了什麼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What they disclosed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "對方揭露了什麼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What this app can prove": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個 App 能證明什麼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What this check did not establish": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這次查驗沒有確認的事"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What this does": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個功能做什麼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What this does not establish:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這份證明沒有證明的事："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What this means": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這代表什麼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What would have to change": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要改變什麼才做得到"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where your key lives, how your credentials are protected, and what identifier you present.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的金鑰在哪、憑證受什麼保護、你出示的是哪個識別碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whether it has been cancelled can only be known online, and the list that says so is vouched for by nothing this phone can check offline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它有沒有被註銷只有連上網才知道，而說明這件事的那份清單，沒有任何這支手機離線查得動的東西替它背書。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whether this document has been revoked cannot be checked offline.": {
      "comment": "Shown alongside a successful offline verification",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "離線狀態無法確認這份證件是否已被撤銷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who signed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "誰簽署的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "進行中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes, this app can show that": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "是，這個 App 做得到"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You will use TW FiDO to retrieve your National ID data, and create a valid document.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你將使用行動自然人憑證，從MyData取得自己的數位身分資料，建立一張正式證件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll be asked to approve this in the 行動自然人憑證 app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "過程中會請你到行動自然人憑證 App 完成核可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your ID number": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的身分證統一編號"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your certificate signs these details, which is what lets anyone checking them see that you are the one making the claim.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由你的憑證簽署這些欄位，查驗的人才看得出來，是你本人在主張這些內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your citizen certificate couldn't be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法讀取你的自然人憑證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your citizen certificate doesn't match the signature of MOICA G3.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的自然人憑證通不過內政部憑證管理中心第三代（G3）的簽章驗證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your citizen certificate expired on %@. Renew it before generating a proof.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的自然人憑證已於 %@ 到期，請更新後再產生證明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your citizen certificate isn't valid until %@. Check your device's date and time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的自然人憑證要到 %@ 才生效，請檢查裝置的日期與時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your citizen certificate was issued by %@, which this version can't prove. Only certificates from MOICA G3 are supported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的自然人憑證由%@簽發，這一版還無法為它產生證明；目前只支援內政部憑證管理中心第三代（G3）簽發的憑證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your credentials, the source documents, and your device key will be deleted. The next document you create will use a new identifier and cannot be linked to the current one. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的憑證、原始文件與裝置金鑰都會被刪除。之後重新建立的證件會使用全新的識別碼，無法與目前這一個連結起來。此動作無法復原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your document could be readable from a copy of the device's storage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有人拿到這支手機的儲存內容副本時，可能讀得到你的證件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your documents are encrypted at rest": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的證件在裝置上是加密的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your documents stay off iCloud": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的證件不會進 iCloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your identity documents would be copied into every iCloud backup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的身分證件會被複製進每一次 iCloud 備份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name is always visible. It is written inside the certificate that signs the document, and the checker needs that certificate to check the signature — so no switch can withhold it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "姓名一定看得到。它寫在替這份文件簽章的憑證裡，而查驗方需要那張憑證才驗得了簽章——所以沒有任何開關扣得住它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name is written into the certificate that signs this document, and the checker needs that certificate to check the signature.": {
      "comment": "Why the name row has no switch",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "姓名寫在替這份證件簽章的憑證裡，而查驗方需要那張憑證才能驗簽。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own backed-up ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你自己備份的身分證"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own digital certificate. That shows you are the one making these claims — not that the government has confirmed them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你自己的自然人憑證。這證明的是「這些主張出自你本人」，不是政府已經確認過這些內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your signature may have gone through, but the result could not be fetched. Check this device's connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的簽章可能已經完成，但結果拿不回來。請確認這支手機的網路，再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your signing key is in hardware": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的簽署金鑰放在硬體裡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zero-knowledge proof": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "零知識證明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "not reported": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未回報"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "with Taiwan's official MyData service": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "透過台灣官方MyData服務"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "內政部 is told your ID number and which service asked, every time a proof is made. This hides you from the person checking the proof, not from 內政部.": {
      "comment": "Limitation attached to a zero-knowledge proof",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每產生一次證明，內政部都會知道你的身分證統一編號，以及是哪個服務提出要求。這份證明對查驗的人隱藏了你的身分，對內政部沒有。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "內政部 needs this to send the signing request to your phone. It goes to 內政部 and nowhere else, and this app does not keep it — but 內政部 records that you asked, and which service asked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "內政部需要這個號碼才能把簽章請求推送到你的手機。它只會送給內政部，不會送到別的地方，這個 App 也不會保存它——但內政部會留下你提出過要求、以及是哪個服務要求的紀錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
